{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54281","headline":"送洪州禾山和尚偈（题拟） · 道虔","name":"送洪州禾山和尚偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将宝类宝意不殊，瑠璃线贯瑠璃珠。\n内外双通无异迳，欝我家园桂一株。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道虔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}